10 TIMES MORE LIKELY TO DIE.

00:02:21.842 --> 00:02:23.477
THE COVID VACCINATION, IT’S NOT

00:02:23.488 --> 00:02:25.012
SOMETHING THAT CAME ON

00:02:25.023 --> 00:02:25.544
OVERNIGHT.

