IT’S VERY EFFECTIVE.

00:02:31.826 --> 00:02:33.080
I’VE GOTTEN ONE.

00:02:33.091 --> 00:02:34.832
EVERYONE IN MY FAMILY HAS GOTTEN

00:02:34.867 --> 00:02:35.929
FULLY VACCINATED.

00:02:35.931 --> 00:02:38.200
AND I REALLY ENCOURAGE PEOPLE TO

00:02:38.211 --> 00:02:39.889
GET VACCINATED, NOT JUST TO

00:02:39.890 --> 00:02:42.063
PROTECT YOURSELF BUT ALSO PEOPLE

00:02:42.074 --> 00:02:44.170
AROUND YOU, OUR ECONOMY, OUR

00:02:44.181 --> 00:02:47.208
