THIS IS A GREAT DISCOVERY.

00:02:49.091 --> 00:02:50.731
NO CORNERS WERE CUT.

00:02:50.742 --> 00:02:53.577
WE’VE HAD HUNDREDS OF MILLIONS

00:02:53.588 --> 00:02:55.914
OF PEOPLE VACCINATED AND SERIOUS

00:02:55.948 --> 00:02:57.041
SIDE EFFECTS ARE EXTRAORDINARILY

00:02:57.043 --> 00:02:57.576
RARE.

