THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF ANY

00:03:00.222 --> 00:03:01.682
LONG-TERM NEGATIVE CONSEQUENCES.

00:03:01.693 --> 00:03:04.577
BUT I UNDERSTAND THAT PEOPLE

00:03:04.612 --> 00:03:06.357
HAVE CONCERNS N, THEY HAVE

00:03:06.358 --> 00:03:07.661
QUESTIONS, THEY’RE TIRED OF

00:03:07.672 --> 00:03:09.747
COVID AND YES, MANY PEOPLE WHO

00:03:09.758 --> 00:03:11.676
GET COVID AREN’T SERIOUSLY ILL

