00:03:22.663 --> 00:03:24.519
LIKELY TO DIE FROM NOT HAVING

00:03:24.530 --> 00:03:25.349
THE VACCINATION.

00:03:25.383 --> 00:03:27.518
AND YOU MENTIONED FLORIDA, FOR

00:03:27.529 --> 00:03:28.015
EXAMPLE.

00:03:28.026 --> 00:03:30.625
WHY IS THE RISK OF DEATH AND OF

00:03:30.636 --> 00:03:32.812
GETTING COVID IN FLORIDA AS YOU

00:03:32.823 --> 00:03:34.099
JUST MENTIONED, WHY IS IT SO

00:03:34.110 --> 00:03:34.874
HIGH?

00:03:34.908 --> 00:03:37.854
&gt;&gt; AS GREAT AS VACCINES ARE AND

00:03:37.865 --> 00:03:39.753
AS EFFECTIVE AS THE COVID

00:03:39.764 --> 00:03:40.950
VACCINATION IS, IT’S NOT

00:03:40.961 --> 00:03:42.265
SOMETHING THAT CAN BE DONE ALL

00:03:42.299 --> 00:03:43.239
ON ITS OWN.

00:03:43.250 --> 00:03:45.436
FIRST OFF, WE NEED A MUCH HIGHER

00:03:45.470 --> 00:03:47.148
PROPORTION OF PEOPLE VACCINATED.

00:03:47.149 --> 00:03:49.211
SECOND, DELTA IS SO INFECTIOUS

00:03:49.222 --> 00:03:51.546
THAT IN SOME SETTINGS WE NEED

00:03:51.557 --> 00:03:53.442
MULTIPLE LAYERS OF PROTECTION.

00:03:53.453 --> 00:03:56.509
THAT MEANS MASKING UP INDOORS,

00:03:56.520 --> 00:03:57.658
INCREASING VENTILATION, TESTING,

00:03:57.692 --> 00:03:59.839
PROVIDING SERVICES TO PEOPLE WHO

00:03:59.850 --> 00:04:01.789
HAVE COVID AND TO THEIR CONTACTS

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:03.856
SO THAT CHAINS OF TRANSMISSION

00:04:03.867 --> 00:04:04.643
CAN STOP.

00:04:04.677 --> 00:04:06.792
THE VIRUS HASN’T STOPPED KILLING

00:04:06.793 --> 00:04:09.289
PEOPLE EVEN THOUGH WE’VE GOTTEN

00:04:09.300 --> 00:04:10.562
TIRED OF HEARING ABOUT IT

00:04:10.563 --> 00:04:12.028
BECAUSE 18 MONTHS IT’S TIME WE

00:04:12.039 --> 00:04:14.662
FEEL TO GO OUT AND IGNORE IT BUT

00:04:14.673 --> 00:04:16.389
IF WE IGNORE IT, IT WILL COME

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:17.882
