00:04:17.917 --> 00:04:19.363
ERIC:  YOU MENTIONED DELTA BEING

00:04:19.374 --> 00:04:19.761
DEADLY.

00:04:19.772 --> 00:04:21.837
WHAT ARE YOUR CONCERNS ABOUT THE

00:04:21.871 --> 00:04:23.668
NEW VARIANT THAT IS APPARENTLY

00:04:23.669 --> 00:04:26.370
IN EVERY STATE, ALMOST EVERY

00:04:26.381 --> 00:04:28.412
STATE, THE MU, SPELLED M-U

00:04:28.423 --> 00:04:29.846
VARIANT, WHAT IS THAT?

00:04:29.857 --> 00:04:31.191
HOW BAD IS IT?

00:04:31.202 --> 00:04:32.780
ARE WE PROTECTED AGAINST THAT

00:04:32.791 --> 00:04:34.359
WITH THE VACCINES THAT WE HAVE?

00:04:34.360 --> 00:04:36.138
&gt;&gt; ONE THING AT A TIME.

00:04:36.139 --> 00:04:37.105
DELTA IS STILL THE DOMINANT

00:04:37.116 --> 00:04:37.629
VARIANT.

00:04:37.663 --> 00:04:39.676
IT’S SO INFECTIOUS THAT IT’S

00:04:39.677 --> 00:04:41.601
DIFFICULT FOR OTHER VARIANTS TO

00:04:41.612 --> 00:04:43.185
TAKE OVER FROM IT.

00:04:43.196 --> 00:04:44.740
SECOND, OUR VACCINES WORK

00:04:44.751 --> 00:04:45.866
AGAINST THE VARIANTS OF OUT

00:04:45.877 --> 00:04:46.242
THERE.

00:04:46.276 --> 00:04:48.984
THEY MAY WORK A LITTLE LESS WELL

00:04:48.985 --> 00:04:50.108
BUT THEY STILL WORK

00:04:50.119 --> 00:04:51.906
EXTRAORDINARILY WELL BUT THE BIG

00:04:51.917 --> 00:04:54.094
CONCERN IS THAT IF WE CONTINUE

00:04:54.105 --> 00:04:55.723
TO ALLOW THIS VIRUS TO SPREAD

00:04:55.757 --> 00:04:57.865
AROUND THE U.S. AND AROUND THE

00:04:57.866 --> 00:04:59.486
WORLD WITHOUT BEING CONTROLLED,

00:04:59.488 --> 00:05:01.765
THERE IS A HIGH LIKELIHOOD THAT

00:05:01.767 --> 00:05:04.383
A FUTURE VARIANT WOULD BE EVEN

00:05:04.385 --> 00:05:05.648
MORE DEADLY OR DANGEROUS THAN

00:05:05.649 --> 00:05:06.113
DELTA.

00:05:06.124 --> 00:05:08.367
THAT’S WHY IT’S SO IMPORTANT

00:05:08.378 --> 00:05:10.290
THAT WE INCREASE VACCINATIONS,

00:05:10.301 --> 00:05:12.660
THAT WE HAVE A MULTILAYER WAY OF

00:05:12.671 --> 00:05:14.503
PROTECTING SO WE TAMP DOWN

00:05:14.514 --> 00:05:16.803
SPREAD AND THAT WE TRACK THE

00:05:16.814 --> 00:05:18.283
VIRUS AND STAY ONE STEP AHEAD OF

00:05:18.317 --> 00:05:19.004
IT.

00:05:19.015 --> 00:05:22.212
ERIC:  GET THE SHOT, WEAR YOUR

00:05:22.223 --> 00:05:25.790
